{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>酷派集團擬進行2供1，供股集資超過5,900萬元。</p><p></p><p>每股供股價0.3元，較上日收市價折讓逾三成二，涉及發行逾1.98億股供股股份。集資所得主要用於與AI基礎設施相關的解決方案業務，採購AI服務器硬件及核心零部件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T00:59:12.018382+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:49.188995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:37.339912+00:00","content_hash":"da08fb7515b2f0fc0a35640f8060a96dca05313a191628ffff6bf17d0485af39","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}